#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:2
msgid "Telos or Tmote Sky"
msgstr "Telos ili Tmote Sky"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:4
msgid ""
"*This page has been posted in response to many emails we have received "
"asking about interfacing the Tmote Sky boards with the CMUcam3. We have "
"tested that the power connections work, however we have not run any "
"application code on the Tmote boards to communicate with the CMUcam3. From "
"discussions with other people the configuration seems to be functional, but "
"please use with caution.*"
msgstr ""
"*Ova je stranica objavljena kao odgovor na mnoge e-poruke koje smo primili s"
" pitanjima o povezivanju Tmote Sky ploča s CMUcam3. Testirali smo da spojevi"
" napajanja rade, no nismo pokrenuli nikakav aplikacijski kod na Tmote "
"pločama za komunikaciju s CMUcam3. Iz razgovora s drugim ljudima čini se da "
"je konfiguracija funkcionalna, no molimo koristite je s oprezom.*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:10
msgid ""
"The CMUcam3 can connect to either the Tmote Sky or Telos board using the "
"CMUcam3's AUX I/O header. This allows the TTL UARTs to be connected as well "
"as the board power and various other GPIO pins. We currently do not have any"
" sample code available for TinyOS, but (as always) we would be interested in"
" posting anything that people contribute."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam3 se može spojiti na Tmote Sky ili Telos pločicu koristeći AUX I/O "
"header CMUcam3. Ovo omogućuje spajanje TTL UART-ova kao i napajanja pločice "
"te raznih drugih GPIO pinova. Trenutno nemamo dostupan nikakav uzorak koda "
"za TinyOS, ali (kao i uvijek) bili bismo zainteresirani objaviti sve što "
"ljudi doprinesu."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:16
msgid ""
"*Warning: Do not connect a Tmote Sky board directly to the CMUcam3 and power"
" both devices off of an AC adapter with resistor R6 installed!*"
msgstr ""
"*Upozorenje: Ne spajajte Tmote Sky ploču izravno na CMUcam3 i ne napajajte "
"oba uređaja iz AC adaptera s ugrađenim otpornikom R6!*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:19
msgid ""
"By default the *AUX POWER* pin on the CMUcam3's AUX I/O header is directly "
"connected to the power input to the CMUcam3. This allows an external "
"connection to the AUX I/O header to power the CMUcam3 board. In many cases "
"when the CMUcam3 is given a large power supply such as from an outlet, you "
"may want to change this configuration to power the wireless node directly "
"from the CMUcam'3 internal regulator. This can be done by moving the "
"resistor at R6 to R11. It is also possible to run the CMUcam3 and the sensor"
" board independently by removing both R6 and R11. This can be a useful "
"configuration if you would like the sensor node to be able to power the "
"CMUcam3 on and off using the Power Enable pin on the CMUcam3."
msgstr ""
"Prema zadanim postavkama, pin *AUX POWER* na AUX I/O headeru CMUcam3 izravno"
" je spojen na ulaz napajanja CMUcam3. To omogućuje da vanjski spoj na AUX "
"I/O header napaja ploču CMUcam3. U mnogim slučajevima kada se CMUcam3 daje "
"veliko napajanje, poput onog iz utičnice, možda ćete htjeti promijeniti ovu "
"konfiguraciju kako biste bežični čvor napajali izravno iz internog "
"regulatora CMUcam3. To se može učiniti premještanjem otpornika s R6 na R11. "
"Također je moguće pokretati CMUcam3 i senzorsku ploču neovisno uklanjanjem "
"oba, R6 i R11. Ovo može biti korisna konfiguracija ako želite da senzorski "
"čvor može uključivati i isključivati CMUcam3 pomoću pina Power Enable na "
"CMUcam3."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:29
msgid ""
"The AUX I/O power diagram (``aux_io_power.png``) was not preserved in the "
"archive."
msgstr ""
"Dijagram napajanja AUX I/O (``aux_io_power.png``) nije sačuvan u arhivi."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:31
msgid ""
"Below are two examples of how to power the CMUcam3 and a sensor node from "
"battery supplies. The left option allows the sensor board to remain on at "
"all times such that it can gate the power supply to the camera. The right "
"option is simpler to implement, but does not allow for the camera to be "
"powered down into its lowest consuming sleep mode. This option is ideal if "
"the CMUcam3 is getting supplied from an AC adapter or other larger source of"
" energy."
msgstr ""
"Ispod su dva primjera kako napajati CMUcam3 i senzorski čvor iz baterijskih "
"napajanja. Lijeva opcija omogućuje da senzorska ploča ostane uključena u "
"svakom trenutku tako da može upravljati napajanjem kamere. Desna opcija je "
"jednostavnija za implementaciju, ali ne omogućuje isključivanje kamere u "
"njezin način mirovanja s najnižom potrošnjom. Ova je opcija idealna ako se "
"CMUcam3 napaja iz AC adaptera ili drugog većeg izvora energije."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:38
msgid ""
"The separate-supply and joint-supply diagrams (``seperate_supply.png`` and "
"``joint_supply.png``) were not preserved in the archive."
msgstr ""
"Dijagrami odvojenog napajanja i zajedničkog napajanja "
"(``seperate_supply.png`` i ``joint_supply.png``) nisu sačuvani u arhivi."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:41
msgid ""
"This images shows how to connect a Tmote Sky board to the CMUcam3. Note, "
"that the battery has been removed and a receptical (S6105-ND from `Digikey "
"<http://www.digikey.com>`__ ) has been soldered onto the bottom side of the "
"Tmote Sky board."
msgstr ""
"Ova slika pokazuje kako spojiti Tmote Sky pločicu na CMUcam3. Napomena, "
"baterija je uklonjena i utičnica (S6105-ND od `Digikey "
"<http://www.digikey.com>`__ ) zalemljena je na donju stranu Tmote Sky "
"pločice."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/telos-tmote.rst:46
msgid ""
"The Tmote back and side photos (``tmote_back_sm.jpg`` and "
